[0.0,"o","  \u001b[2mWhen a Kubernetes pod terminates, its local data vanishes.\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n  \u001b[2mGCO mounts Amazon EFS into every cluster so job outputs,\u001b(B\u001b[m\r\n"]
